---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HorizontalCard from "../components/HorizontalCard.astro";


---
<BaseLayout title="Bentsoft">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">
    Bentsoft turns your messy stack of tools into a well-oiled machine.
  </h1>

  <img class="my-4 mx-auto rounded-md" src='https://i.postimg.cc/8f1S6pzx/2.png' alt='Bentsoft logo' />

  <br />

  <p class="text-xl">
    In my years of experience working in software, I&#39;ve come to realise how even big, successful businesses struggle with efficiency. 
    They are often effective, hence their size and success, but I often wonder how much bigger and more successful they&#39;d be if 
    they got everybody on the same page, and especially, every tool on the same page.
    <br /> <br />
    There is no perfect tool for any specific purpose. You can use an Excel sheet as your CRM or CPQ, and get surprisingly far, 
    if you do it correctly. Should you? Probably not, but it can work very well and will certainly be interesting. What you need is 
    to have a grip on your tools, so you don’t leave performance on the table, and don’t overpay for what you don’t need.
    <br /><br />
    I&#39;ve specialized in wrangling these tools. Clean them, improve them, connect them, and make them welcoming to their users.
    <br /><br />
    <b>Through Bentsoft, I help you minimize time-to-value and excel at change.</b>
    <br /><br />
    
  </p>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="Your entire business, simplified."
    desc="Automations, integrations and improved processes will give your team their time back."
    img="https://i.postimg.cc/8f1S6pzx/2.png"
    url="https://bentsoft.net"
    target="_blank"
  />
  <br><br>
  <!-- Calendly badge widget begin -->
<link href="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.css" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.js" type="text/javascript" async></script>
<script type="text/javascript">window.onload = function() { Calendly.initBadgeWidget({ url: 'https://calendly.com/carlos-zaldivar-b/30min', text: 'Schedule time with me', color: '#f59e0b', textColor: '#000000', branding: false }); }</script>
<!-- Calendly badge widget end -->
</BaseLayout>



<script>
</script>